1
00:05:26,399 --> 00:05:32,399
The story of a life and everything that came after...

2
00:10:52,799 --> 00:10:58,799
The Lovely Bones is a fantasy, drama film directed by Peter Jackson.

3
00:16:19,199 --> 00:16:25,199
After being brutally murdered, 14-year-old Susie Salmon watches from
heaven over her grief-stricken family -- and her killer.

4
00:21:45,599 --> 00:21:51,599
As she observes their daily lives, she must balance her thirst for
revenge with her desire for her family to heal.

5
00:27:12,000 --> 00:27:18,000
Susie Salmon, played by Saoirse Ronan.

6
00:32:38,399 --> 00:32:44,399
Jack Salmon, played by Mark Wahlberg.

7
00:38:04,799 --> 00:38:10,799
Abigail Salmon, played by Rachel Weisz.

8
00:43:31,199 --> 00:43:37,199
Grandma Lynn, played by Susan Sarandon.

9
00:48:57,599 --> 00:49:03,599
George Harvey, played by Stanley Tucci.

10
00:54:24,000 --> 00:54:30,000
Lindsey Salmon, played by Rose McIver.

11
00:59:50,399 --> 00:59:56,399
The Lovely Bones is a 2009 supernatural drama film directed by Peter Jackson
from a screenplay he co-wrote with Fran Walsh and Philippa Boyens.

12
01:05:16,799 --> 01:05:22,799
It is based on Alice Sebold's 2002 novel.

13
01:10:43,199 --> 01:10:49,199
The film stars Mark Wahlberg, Rachel Weisz, Susan Sarandon,
Stanley Tucci, Michael Imperioli, and Saoirse Ronan.

14
01:16:09,599 --> 01:16:15,599
The plot follows a girl who was murdered and
watches over her family from heaven.

15
01:21:36,000 --> 01:21:42,000
She is torn between seeking vengeance on her killer
and allowing her family to heal.

16
01:27:02,399 --> 01:27:08,399
A co-production between the United States, the United Kingdom, and New Zealand, The Lovely Bones was produced by Carolynne Cunningham,
Walsh, Jackson, and Aimee Peyronnet, with Steven Spielberg, Tessa Ross, Ken Kamins, and James Wilson as executive producers.

17
01:32:28,799 --> 01:32:34,799
Principal photography began in October 2007 in New Zealand and Pennsylvania.

18
01:37:55,199 --> 01:38:01,199
The film's score was composed by Brian Eno.

19
01:43:21,599 --> 01:43:27,599
The Lovely Bones premiered in London on November 24, 2009, and was wide released in New
Zealand on December 26, 2009 and in the United States on January 15, 2010.

20
01:48:48,000 --> 01:48:54,000
It received mixed-to-unfavorable reviews from critics; the story and its message were generally criticized,
but the visual effects, the direction, and the performances of Ronan and Tucci were praised.

21
01:54:14,399 --> 01:54:20,399
At the world box office, The Lovely Bones grossed $93.6
million on a $65 million production budget.

22
01:59:40,799 --> 01:59:46,799
Tucci was nominated for Best Supporting Actor at the Oscars, the Golden Globes and
the BAFTAs, where Ronan also received a Best Actress nomination.

23
02:05:07,199 --> 02:05:13,199
The film explores themes of rape, based on novel or
book, afterlife, loss of loved one, tree.

24
02:10:33,599 --> 02:10:39,599
The tone is dark and emotional.
